    "items": [
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105274?u=173310b843e2751843265438af8cfb79eda02039&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Firefox: <code class=\"notranslate\">import defer</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">import.defer()</code> are supported in Nightly behind the <code class=\"notranslate\">javascript.options.experimental.defer_import_eval</code> preference, compiled into Nightly builds only</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://bugzil.la/1952263\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzil.la/1952263</a>, landed in 158</li>\n<li>Tested in Nightly 159 with the preference on. Without the preference, <code class=\"notranslate\">import defer</code> is a <code class=\"notranslate\">SyntaxError</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5617210106\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45892\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/45892/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45892\">mdn/content#45892</a></li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30807",
            "title": "Add Firefox Nightly support for import defer",
            "date_modified": "2026-10-08T21:11:02.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-10-08T21:10:29.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "pepelsbey",
                "url": "https://github.com/pepelsbey"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34835685?u=e2ff4ec7833b26c17f1a88cdf362c71fce685835&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Mark <code class=\"notranslate\">Error.isError()</code> as fully supported in Safari TP</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Safari has fixed it in preview (see <a href=\"https://webkit.org/b/321064\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://webkit.org/b/321064</a>).</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Not in release notes but <a href=\"https://commits.webkit.org/318930@main\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://commits.webkit.org/318930@main</a> is in Safari TP 251. See the commit range at <a href=\"https://webkit.org/blog/18194/release-notes-for-safari-technology-preview-251/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://webkit.org/blog/18194/release-notes-for-safari-technology-preview-251/</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Safari TP passes the WPT: <a href=\"https://wpt.fyi/results/webidl/ecmascript-binding/es-exceptions/DOMException-is-error.any.html?label=experimental&amp;label=master&amp;aligned\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://wpt.fyi/results/webidl/ecmascript-binding/es-exceptions/DOMException-is-error.any.html?label=experimental&amp;label=master&amp;aligned</a></p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Previously: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5119934504\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30211\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30211/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30211\">#30211</a></li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30806",
            "title": "Safari TP now supports `Error.isError()` fully",
            "date_modified": "2026-10-08T19:18:09.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-10-08T19:17:26.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "barhatsor",
                "url": "https://github.com/barhatsor"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105274?u=173310b843e2751843265438af8cfb79eda02039&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">mediatypes.image.jxl</code>: Firefox <code class=\"notranslate\">158</code>, replacing <code class=\"notranslate\">preview</code></li>\n<li>Added <code class=\"notranslate\">mdn_url</code> for the JPEG XL section of the image types guide</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://bugzil.la/2065096\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzil.la/2065096</a> sets <code class=\"notranslate\">image.jxl.enabled</code> to <code class=\"notranslate\">true</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5617216463\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45896\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/45896/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45896\">mdn/content#45896</a></li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30805",
            "title": "FF158 image/jxl enabled by default",
