        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75256866?u=be160348e1d9b69d40ca8031cbcead2d0aea9bfb&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #21132.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1971116477\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/21132\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/21132/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/21132\">#21132</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">ScreenOrientation.lock()</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">unlock()</code> previously mirrored <code class=\"notranslate\">chrome_android</code> for Android WebView. As noted by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/caugner/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/caugner\">@caugner</a> in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1971116477\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/21132\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/21132/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/21132\">#21132</a>, based on <a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/40409069\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://issues.chromium.org/issues/40409069</a>, <code class=\"notranslate\">lock()</code> always throws in WebView Android, so it is not usable there.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR sets <code class=\"notranslate\">webview_android.version_added: false</code> for <code class=\"notranslate\">api.ScreenOrientation.lock</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">api.ScreenOrientation.unlock</code>.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30750",
            "title": "ScreenOrientation: Mark lock and unlock as unsupported on Android WebView",
            "date_modified": "2026-10-06T22:38:18.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-10-05T08:21:43.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "mustafacicek-eee",
                "url": "https://github.com/mustafacicek-eee"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75256866?u=be160348e1d9b69d40ca8031cbcead2d0aea9bfb&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Updates the <code class=\"notranslate\">chrome</code> (and mirrored browsers) <code class=\"notranslate\">version_added</code> for <code class=\"notranslate\">css.types.color.alpha</code> from <code class=\"notranslate\">\"151\"</code> to <code class=\"notranslate\">\"152\"</code>.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Chrome Platform Status: <a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/5070160203481088\" rel=\"nofollow\">Relative Alpha Colors (CSS Color 5 alpha() function)</a> lists milestone 152.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"https://developer.chrome.com/release-notes/152\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chrome 152 release notes</a> announce \"Relative alpha colors (CSS Color 5 <code class=\"notranslate\">alpha()</code> function)\".</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">npm run lint</code> and Prettier pass locally.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #30731.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5702441458\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30731\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30731/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30731\">#30731</a></p>",
